CROP-NAV

This distribution contains a compact research implementation of CROP-NAV.

Parts of the context-attention assembly, trajectory encoder, recurrent slot
update structure, view scorer, token scorer, and waypoint head were adapted
from the Apache-2.0 LLaMA-UAV source tree used for this work, including its
LLaMA-VID/LLaVA and LongFly components.

The upstream language-model source carries the following notice:
Copyright 2023 Haotian Liu

Modifications in this distribution include modular APIs, explicit recurrent
state, physical directional routing, paper-defined IGTA residual voting and
attention weighting, spatial-only token selection, and simplified prompt
packing. This distribution does not include upstream pretrained model
implementations, pretrained model weights, or datasets. Their respective
licenses apply when those assets are supplied separately.
